    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "test:e2e:ui": "playwright test --ui"
  }
}
```

## Why these matter for LLM output

Pre-2024 trained models will produce:

- `new App({ target: document.body })` for component tests (anti-pattern #40, removed in Svelte 5)
- Hand-rolled `mount(App, { target })` without `unmount()` (anti-pattern #40, leaks across tests)
- Cypress component config as the recommended path (NOT the documented Svelte 5 stack)
- `vitest.config.ts` without `pool: 'forks'` (Vitest 4 default flipped from v3 `'threads'`)
